rong data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"430\">40Gbps data transfer rates</strong>, this <strong data-start=\"437\" data-end=\"476\">compact and lightweight transceiver</strong> ensures <strong data-start=\"485\" data-end=\"554\">seamless, low-latency connections for high-bandwidth applications</strong>.</p><hr data-start=\"559\" data-end=\"562\"><h3><strong data-start=\"567\" data-end=\"597\">Key Features &amp; Benefits</strong></h3><p data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"1448\"><strong data-start=\"603\" data-end=\"635\">High-Speed 40GbE Performance</strong> – Supports <strong data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"678\">40 Gbps data transfer rates</strong> for <strong data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"708\">ultra-fast networking<br></strong><strong data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"734\">QSFP+ Form Factor</strong> – Compact <strong data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"796\">Quad Small Form-Factor Pluggable (QSFP+) design</strong> ensures <strong data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"841\">easy integration and scalability</strong><br data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"844\"><strong data-start=\"846\" data-end=\"867\">MPO SR4 Interface</strong> – Utilizes <strong data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"919\">MPO (Multi-Fiber Push-On) connectors</strong> for <strong data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"966\">efficient multi-lane data transmission</strong><br data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"969\"><strong data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"1003\">Optimized for HPE Networking</strong> – Designed for <strong data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1087\">HPE Networking Comware family switches and data center equipment</strong><br data-start=\"1087\" data-end=\"1090\"><strong data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1126\">Energy-Efficient &amp; Low-Latency</strong> – Reduces <strong data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1201\">power consumption while maintaining high-speed data transfer</strong><br data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1204\"><strong data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1238\">Lightweight &amp; Compact Design</strong> – Weighs only <strong data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1273\">0.18 kg (0.4 lb)</strong> with dimensions of <strong data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1341\">12.45 x 22.61 x 6.35 cm (4.9 x 8.9 x 2.5 in)</strong><br data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1344\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1376\">Plug-and-Play Installation</strong> – Simplifies <strong data-start=\"1390\" data-end=\"1446\">network expansion and upgrades with quick deployment</strong></p><hr data-start=\"1450\" data-end=\"1453\"><h3><strong data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1489\">Technical Specifications</strong></h3><p data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1921\"><strong data-start=\"1496\" data-end=\"1504\">Type</strong>: <strong data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1550\">QSFP+ (Quad Small Form-Factor Pluggable)</strong><br data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1553\"><strong data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1574\">Transfer Speed</strong>: <strong data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1587\">40 Gbps</strong><br data-start=\"1587\" data-end=\"1590\"><strong data-start=\"1593\" data-end=\"1611\">Connector Type</strong>: <strong data-start=\"1613\" data-end=\"1646\">MPO (Multi-Fiber Push-On) SR4</strong><br data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1649\"><strong data-start=\"1652\" data-end=\"1669\">Compatibility</strong>: Designed for <strong data-start=\"1684\" data-end=\"1717\">HPE Networking Comware Family</strong><br data-start=\"1717\" data-end=\"1720\"><strong data-start=\"1723\" data-end=\"1733\">Weight</strong>: <strong data-start=\"1735\" data-end=\"1755\">0.18 kg (0.4 lb)</strong><br data-start=\"1755\" data-end=\"1758\"><strong data-start=\"1761\" data-end=\"1775\">Dimensions</strong>: <strong data-start=\"1777\" data-end=\"1825\">12.45 x 22.61 x 6.35 cm (4.9 x 8.9 x 2.5 in)</strong><br data-start=\"1825\" data-end=\"1828\"><strong data-start=\"1831\" data-end=\"1858\">Energy-Efficient Design</strong>: Optimized for <strong data-start=\"1874\" data-end=\"1919\">low power consumption and high efficiency</strong></p><hr data-start=\"1923\" data-end=\"1926\"><